 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Agent tools
+
+The hydrated sign-in and sign-up forms expose `sign_in` and `sign_up`, respectively,
+through [WebMCP](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/imperative-api).
+Each tool accepts `{ "username": "…", "password": "…" }` and returns
+`{ "ok": true | false, "message": "…" }` after the request finishes.
+The tools use the same submission logic and visible loading, error, and success
+states as the forms. Registration clears the inputs on success; it does not sign
+the user in. Password requirements are enforced by the existing registration API.
+Credentials and response tokens are not included in tool results.
+
+Tools register when their form mounts and unregister when it unmounts, including
+during Astro page navigation. Registration supports `document.modelContext` and
+the earlier `navigator.modelContext` API. Browsers without WebMCP retain ordinary
+form behavior. No additional server or agent endpoint is required.
+
+Run `pnpm test` (Node.js 22.6 or newer) for mocked request and tool lifecycle tests,
+and `pnpm build` to validate the production build.
